TandemSSH modifications include independent branding and release channels,
Chinese defaults, human/AI shared-session control, scoped command and file
policies, task workflows, MCP pairing and tools, file editing and transfers,
and SSH host trust. Actual implementation and remaining scope are tracked
in docs/12-implementation.md and the feature documents.

The user's codexBackground/codexStyle project (Zhqiankun/codexDream) was
consulted for update and release behavior. TandemSSH has its own update
service and does not use the CodexStyle update feed.
